<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nūtrīmentum</span></b> , i,
			n.
		nutrio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>nourishment, nutriment</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: per hanc nutrimentorum consuetudinem.
				<i><span class="en">Suet. Calig.
			9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>support,
				nourishment</i>, etc.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pro nutrimento omni est raritas vulneris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 23, 36, § 213</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suscepitque ignem foliis atque arida circum
					Nutrimenta dedit,</span>”
				i. e. <i>fuel</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 1, 176</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nec reddita caro nutrimenta patri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 6, 571</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In gen., <i>support</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eloquentiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Or. 13, 42</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">favoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 2, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">truculentiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 9, p. 234</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In
			partic.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nūtrīmenta</span></b> ,
			ōrum, <i>a bringing up,
				rearing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nutrimentorum ejus locus ostenditur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 6</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
